              "text": "ahnen — \"to suspect, to have a feeling\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ich habe es schon geahnt: Der Zug hat Verspätung. I already had a feeling: the train is late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Keine Ahnung — no idea — belongs to the same family."
            }
          ]
        },
