          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ahnen is inherited from Middle High German anen (EtymDB). It is usually explained as a verb made from an \"on\": a feeling comes upon you."
            }
          ]
        },
